@startuml skip_backup_diagram
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
title Skip Backup Through Iso

box "User Side" #AliceBlue
actor User order 1 #LightCyan
participant Iso order 2 #LightBlue
participant Boomlet order 3 #LightPink
end box

hnote over User #LavenderBlush: Alternative at setup step 72 when User skips backup. User connects Boomlet to Iso.

autonumber 72 "<b>[00]"

' Step 72
User o-> Iso:  <b>SetupIsoInput5 \n magic: "skip_backup" \n mnemonic \n passphrase \n network \n account \n key_index
hnote over Iso #LavenderBlush:  Iso receives {magic: "skip_backup", mnemonic, passphrase, network, account, key_index} \n from User and prepares to sign Boomlet's current setup ID with the normal key.

' Step 73
Boomlet o-> Iso:  <b>SetupBoomletIsoMessage7 \n setup_instance_id
hnote over Iso #LavenderBlush:  Iso receives setup_instance_id from Boomlet, derives the normal key from the \n supplied recovery inputs, and signs setup_instance_id under domain "Boomerang/setup/backup_skip".
hnote over Iso #Lavender:  coin_type := 0 if network is mainnet else 1 \n master_xpriv_0 := derive_master_xpriv(mnemonic, passphrase) \n purpose_xpriv_0 := derive_child_xpriv(master_xpriv_0, 52102, hardened: true) \n coin_xpriv_0 := derive_child_xpriv(purpose_xpriv_0, coin_type, hardened: true) \n account_xpriv_0 := derive_child_xpriv(coin_xpriv_0, account, hardened: true) \n external_xpriv_0 := derive_child_xpriv(account_xpriv_0, 0, hardened: false) \n normal_privkey_0 := derive_child_xpriv(external_xpriv_0, key_index, hardened: false) \n backup_skip_signed_by_normal_0 := sign_message(normal_privkey_0, \n "Boomerang/setup/backup_skip", setup_instance_id)

' Step 74
Iso o-> Boomlet:  <b>SetupIsoBoomletMessage7 \n backup_skip_signed_by_normal_0
hnote over Boomlet #LavenderBlush:  Boomlet receives backup_skip_signed_by_normal_0 from Iso, verifies the \n normal-key signature and current setup ID, requires no stored backup key, and records backup completion. \n Valid retries return the same status.
hnote over Boomlet #Pink:  Assert verify_signature(normal_pubkey_0, "Boomerang/setup/backup_skip", backup_skip_signed_by_normal_0) == True \n Assert backup_skip_signed_by_normal_0.content == setup_instance_id \n Assert setup_state in {SAR_READY, BACKUP_READY} \n Assert boomletwo_Identity_pubkey == Null
hnote over Boomlet #Lavender:  If setup_state == SAR_READY && backup_complete == False: \n backup_complete := True \n save(backup_complete)

ref over User, Iso, Boomlet: Continue setup at step 86

@enduml
